rvice and journal state, restart acknowledgement, independently confirmed changed boot identity, and recovered worker, journal, and platform state were all captured.","limitations":["The timed-out command cmd-745c26b4bba54851 did not capture its complete execution, so mutations beyond its observed leftover sleep process cannot be determined precisely; subsequent checks and lifecycle snapshots show no remaining residue.","Systemd failed-service collection was unsupported on this legacy platform, though direct process checks and other lifecycle observations showed healthy recovered state."]}
